  "details": "People's usernames need to be unique and cannot be changed more than once every three months. Meaning most people's usernames aren't at all what they would like to be called.\n\nThis can especially be an issue for people who can't verbally communicate their preferred name to people for one reason or another. They could be mute, in a household where they don't want it to be overheard, or just generally uncomfortable with having to tell people outright.\n\nHaving an easily changeable and accessible option for a nickname would also be perfect for the use cases outlined in this post:\n\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/vrchat-plus-feature-ideas/p/allow-free-display-name-changes-for-vrc",
